  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM - Sustainable reintegration Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Communities of return benefit from improved access to rehabilitated public 
infrastructure, sustainable reintegration, service continuity, and community stabilisation.

Outcome 2: Belgian reintegration actors and diaspora networks are better informed and better equipped to support safe, voluntary, and sustainable return to Syria.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using an area-based approach, support the early recovery and sustainable reintegration 
of communities of return in Syria, benefiting returnees from Belgium and other countries, as 
well as internally displaced Syrians and host communities. Using an area-based approach, support the early recovery and sustainable reintegration 
